session_id = response.cookies["sessionid"].value

# Send a POST request to the login page with the user credentials
data = {
    "username": username,
    "password": password,
    "sessionid": session_id
}
response = requests.post(target_url, data=data)

# Extract the session ID from the response
session_id = response.cookies["sessionid"].value

# Send a request to the sensitive data page
data = {
    "sessionid": session_id
}
response = requests.get(f"https://example.com/sensitive_data", params=data)

# Extract the sensitive data from the response
sensitive_data = response.text
```
This code uses the `requests` library to send HTTP requests to a website and extract sensitive data

